{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2112622702276100097"]}, "author_id": "1491008385742954497", "created_at": "2026-10-20T19:11:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112622754163736606"], "id": "2112622754163736606", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 80, "like_count": 5, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112528569620402500", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "GROK BOT LOOKS LIKE THE CHEAP ONE. FROM $30 A MONTH VS $100 FOR OPENAI DOTS.\n\nthen you hit the part nobody screenshots.\n\nthe $30 covers a weekly allowance. after that it bills on-demand, with no spend cap by default.\n\none background routine you forgot about can quietly run up a https://t.co/KG4BTyjqhq https://t.co/bCbGGXDTPa", "url": "https://x.com/0xVibeDino/status/2112622754163736606"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2110769879619891200"]}, "author_id": "2100997669196124160", "created_at": "2026-10-20T18:28:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112611809303966165"], "id": "2112611809303966165", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 12, "impression_count": 432, "like_count": 22, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2106803135071035580", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OPENAI AND GROK BOTH GAVE AI AGENTS THEIR OWN COMPUTERS. NEITHER TELLS YOU THE LIMITS.\n\n2 FLEETS RUNNING 24/7, 4,000+ APPS, AND ONE $0.042 GATE BEFORE ANYTHING LEAVES\n\n9 weeks changed the agent game. grok bot went into early beta on aug 11, gpt-6 astra shipped sep 3, claude opus https://t.co/0yhNRp9aK8 https://t.co/Q85DMxVas2", "url": "https://x.com/DonatelloXPro/status/2112611809303966165"}, {"article": {"title": "PART 2  After the AI Bubble: The Shift From Answers to Actions. "}, "author_id": "281349131", "created_at": "2026-10-20T18:12:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112607787205152829"], "id": "2112607787205152829", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2462, "like_count": 62, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "https://t.co/jo8GbWhU9w", "url": "https://x.com/sunshinelu24/status/2112607787205152829"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112573837208403968"]}, "author_id": "1950877451392802816", "created_at": "2026-10-20T15:57:08.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112573842556133416"], "id": "2112573842556133416", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 180, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 5, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "i built 10 ChaGPT DOTS AI agents for EVERYTHING i know about GTM\n\n- 10 always-on ChatGPT Dots\n- 10 different GTM jobs\n- 1 complete setup system\n\nthey have the EXACT instructions needed to handle:\n\n- buyer and audience research\n- competitor funnel analysis\n- warm lead revival\n- https://t.co/zjqX6ryrUl", "url": "https://x.com/jack_9947/status/2112573842556133416"}, {"author_id": "2084427925391015936", "created_at": "2026-10-20T15:53:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112572915593904315"], "id": "2112572915593904315", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 37, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I want to love ChatGPT Dots, and I'm close, but the constant broken permissions, the frequent loss of threads, and the poor proactivity are finding me pushing more and more to Muse.\n\nWhile I slept last night, Muse helped my 90 year old mother, by email, troubleshoot her Apple TV", "url": "https://x.com/MrQuiyst/status/2112572915593904315"}, {"article": {"title": "OPENAI DOTS VS GROK BOT: A $100 EMPLOYEE VS A $30 TEAM"}, "author_id": "1491008385742954497", "created_at": "2026-10-20T12:57:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112528569620402500"], "id": "2112528569620402500", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 8, "impression_count": 337, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/q2ZgQY7gBJ", "url": "https://x.com/0xVibeDino/status/2112528569620402500"}, {"article": {"title": "AI just gave you a team for FREE"}, "author_id": "1465748029839921156", "created_at": "2026-10-20T03:23:13.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112384112950432058"], "id": "2112384112950432058", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 411, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/Orb5TWSYZn", "url": "https://x.com/LeviAcay/status/2112384112950432058"}, {"author_id": "1106495502336606208", "created_at": "2026-10-20T01:08:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112350330147221929"], "id": "2112350330147221929", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1106495502336606208", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 111, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112349662132994109", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ChatGPT The build uses two independent scheduled tasks, plus one structured prompt for @ChatGPT  #DOTS  to build the Site and extension with its own daily workflow.\n\nThe prompts spell out the sources, caveats, archive and what should happen if an update fails.", "url": "https://x.com/moe_cherif/status/2112350330147221929"}, {"author_id": "19210648", "created_at": "2026-10-19T23:15:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112321828207358367"], "id": "2112321828207358367", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1809431242338889729", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112291011292729397", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@finlayekins a factory needs deep verification, the harness will be (is) the factory, not the model.\n\nbut yeah, all our ai engineering work we are pumped about, talk about, and share with others - just becomes features in codex/claude/cursor/devin.\n\nyesterday in codex/chat I used the new", "url": "https://x.com/chrisrickard/status/2112321828207358367"}, {"author_id": "1106741825333796864", "created_at": "2026-10-19T22:51:16.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112315675523899787"], "id": "2112315675523899787", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1106741825333796864", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2112315671786954827", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "For reference, I’ve built and continue to enhance a few internal products to make our company run more smoothly\n- time tracking/project management\n- learning platform\n\nI use codex/claude both in @t3dotcodes (goated) for dev stuff, and primarily Claude for cowork\n\n@OpenAI dots too", "url": "https://x.com/hailsxr/status/2112315675523899787"}, {"author_id": "349362983", "created_at": "2026-10-19T17:23:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112233196972851537"], "id": "2112233196972851537", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 53, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I've been using both @OpenAI Dots and @bot for my work, testing both while working on a large codebase.\n\nI think @bot using @grok is actually a better tool. Like, the underlying model and system is faster and better at getting the work done cleanly.\n\nBut switching between @bot", "url": "https://x.com/masonltompkins/status/2112233196972851537"}, {"article": {"title": "$4,065 a day with Grok Bot on Polymarket. We checked the wallet and the calendar."}, "author_id": "2107962464822300672", "created_at": "2026-10-19T16:24:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112218220535205907"], "id": "2112218220535205907", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/vkgzcUtIt8", "url": "https://x.com/FakeOrNotlab/status/2112218220535205907"}, {"author_id": "18156616", "created_at": "2026-10-19T16:01:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112212428129706173"], "id": "2112212428129706173", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 67, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Two websites. Built and live in a day.\n\nSpent yesterday building with @ChatGPT  dots, while holding my daughter in one hand.\n\nLaunched DANI, an AI consultancy helping people build agentic Ai workflows.\n\nLet’s build - https://t.co/DvEtm68YTK\n\nRebuilt my personal site -", "url": "https://x.com/KaMeek/status/2112212428129706173"}, {"author_id": "2020975172187193345", "created_at": "2026-10-19T13:47:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112178794349957233"], "id": "2112178794349957233", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 34, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You can only trust ONE AI agent to handle your daily workflow.\n\nWho are you picking?\n\n✅OpenAI Dots\n✅Meta Muse\n✅Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/actthepop/status/2112178794349957233"}, {"author_id": "1911127930219962368", "created_at": "2026-10-19T11:39:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112146636377842120"], "id": "2112146636377842120", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 572, "like_count": 23, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 19, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "You can only trust ONE AI agent to handle your daily workflow.\n\nWho are you picking?\n\n-OpenAI Dots\n-Meta Muse\n-Grok Bot", "url": "https://x.com/omarvvvr/status/2112146636377842120"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111890883192709120"]}, "author_id": "2104828504680333312", "created_at": "2026-10-19T09:56:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112120571907682601"], "id": "2112120571907682601", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 6, "impression_count": 297, "like_count": 11, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2106439961117348281", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "1,440 coins in one hour. my AI agent team bought exactly one. +$3,062\n\nYOU APED 14 TODAY. ALL 14 WOULD HAVE DIED AT MY GATE\n\none-person setup, I never touched a button. here is every bot on the crew, one job each:\n\njev → the gate, kills a bad coin in under 100ms\nscout → finds https://t.co/BYf5E2VVL9 https://t.co/SlAt8RsdfH", "url": "https://x.com/Mason33xbt/status/2112120571907682601"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2112074851544698880"]}, "author_id": "2108066855944630272", "created_at": "2026-10-19T06:57:42.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112075700757037434"], "id": "2112075700757037434", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI is moving beyond chatbots to AI coworkers!\n\nChatGPT Dots can keep projects moving across conversations and Codex, while Grok Bot aims to handle tasks across apps and websites.\n\nTwo approaches to AI agents-which one fits your workflow?\n\n#ChatGPT #Dots #OpenAI #Grok #AI #GrokBot https://t.co/oLp3j4bD58", "url": "https://x.com/dcarter_report/status/2112075700757037434"}, {"article": {"title": "🌐 The Week Ahead in Technology : What to Watch (Oct 19-23, 2026)"}, "author_id": "1010938256144420864", "created_at": "2026-10-19T02:09:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2112003150185971994"], "id": "2112003150185971994", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 862, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/xT37BkPkoJ", "url": "https://x.com/TechThought_org/status/2112003150185971994"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2111856732632743936"]}, "author_id": "2076538762360713216", "created_at": "2026-10-18T16:28:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111856925134516689"], "id": "2111856925134516689", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 65, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2105277060478382207", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "OpenAI Dots: How to Set Up an Always-On Agent Without Losing Control\nOpenAI’s new agent gets its own cloud browser, so you sign in to your tools once and it stays signed in. Here’s how to set one up safely.\n\nDots launched at DevDay on Sep 29. Each one has its own cloud computer https://t.co/q6N2pXPsf7 https://t.co/S8S1kKfnoN", "url": "https://x.com/DjohnAgentIncom/status/2111856925134516689"}, {"article": {"title": "Grok Bot、Muse、ChatGPT Dots：三种云端 AI Agent 的架构对比"}, "author_id": "1708486892357033984", "created_at": "2026-10-18T11:06:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111775929227948387"], "id": "2111775929227948387", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 990, "like_count": 15, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/EpUykeZup4", "url": "https://x.com/MrZhang1984/status/2111775929227948387"}, {"article": {"title": "7 Questions to Ask Before You Pick an AI Agent (Plus a Copy-Paste Checklist)"}, "author_id": "2109912017473597440", "created_at": "2026-10-18T10:11:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111761997884710965"], "id": "2111761997884710965", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/or2auOyNN4", "url": "https://x.com/agentplaybox/status/2111761997884710965"}, {"article": {"title": "The Company Around the Agents"}, "author_id": "1794133412690722817", "created_at": "2026-10-17T22:37:47.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2111587505300533517"], "id": "2111587505300533517", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 3, "impression_count": 16691, "like_count": 18, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 21, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "Intelligence is becoming abundant. The authority to use it is not.\n\nI mapped 281 companies building autonomous businesses to find out what’s actually holding agents back, and where